    <statement><p>Consider the path 
    <m>\mathbf{r}(t) = (14 t, 7 t^2, 7\ln t)</m> defined for <m>t &gt; 0</m>.</p>
<p>Find the length of the curve between the points
<m>(14, 7, 0)</m> and <m>(70, 175, 7 \ln(5))</m>.</p>
<p><fillin characters="40" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>168+7\ln\mathopen{}\left(5\right)</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
